---
import ExternalLinkButton from '../../../components/ExternalLinkButton.astro';
import Section from '../../../components/Section.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Xen Spring Meetup 2026';
const description = 'The Xen Project Spring Meetup is a two-day, in-person community event in Grenoble, France.';
const keywords = ['Xen Project', 'Spring Meetup', 'Grenoble', 'community event', 'virtualization'];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <article class="article page-single">
    <div class="container page-top"><h1>{title}</h1><div class="description">{description}</div></div>
    <div class="single-content">
      <Section><div class="full-width-image rounded-corners"><img src="/img/others/spring-meetup-2026/spring-meetup-2026-banner.png" alt={title} loading="lazy" /></div></Section>

      <Section>
        <div id="register" class="uno-card-side uno-mt-6 uno-bg-green-50 dark:uno-bg-green-900/20">
          <div class="content-markdown"><h3>Registration is open</h3><p>Join us in Grenoble on <strong>April 2-3, 2026</strong> for two days of Xen collaboration, research exchange, and community connection.</p><p><strong>Tickets:</strong> $80 USD in-person, $20 USD virtual, $20 USD student. Seats are limited.</p></div>
          <div class="uno-my-4 uno-flex uno-flex-wrap uno-gap-3"><ExternalLinkButton href="https://linuxfoundation.regfox.com/xen-spring-meetup-2026">Register now</ExternalLinkButton><ExternalLinkButton href="https://xenspringmeetup2026.sched.com">View schedule</ExternalLinkButton></div>
        </div>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2>Xen Spring Meetup 2026</h2><p>A two-day, in-person gathering for Xen developers, users, researchers, and ecosystem partners in Grenoble, France.</p>
        <p class="uno-text-sm">Jump to: <a href="#schedule">Schedule</a> · <a href="#event-details">Event details</a> · <a href="#accommodation">Accommodation</a> · <a href="#sponsors">Sponsors</a></p>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2 id="schedule">Schedule</h2><p>The full schedule is available on Sched. Browse talks, speakers, and build your personal agenda before the meetup.</p>
        <ExternalLinkButton href="https://xenspringmeetup2026.sched.com">View the full schedule</ExternalLinkButton>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2 id="event-details">Event details</h2>
        <div class="uno-grid uno-grid-cols-1 md:uno-grid-cols-2 uno-gap-6">
          <div class="uno-card"><h3>Key info</h3><ul><li><strong>Dates:</strong> April 2-3, 2026</li><li><strong>City:</strong> Grenoble, France</li><li><strong>Venue:</strong> Université Grenoble Alpes</li><li><strong>Audience:</strong> Developers, users, researchers, ecosystem partners</li></ul></div>
          <div class="uno-card"><h3>Venue</h3><p>Hosted in the IMAG building at <strong>Université Grenoble Alpes</strong>, home to computer science and systems research including LIG.</p><p>150 Pl. du Torrent<br />38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères<br />France</p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/1ZnR8GwXrapRrcud8">View on Google Maps</a></div>
          <div class="uno-card"><h3>Registration</h3><p>Registration is open with in-person, virtual, and student ticket options.</p><ExternalLinkButton href="https://linuxfoundation.regfox.com/xen-spring-meetup-2026">Register now</ExternalLinkButton></div>
          <div class="uno-card"><h3>Travel</h3><p>Grenoble is well connected by train via Lyon and reachable from major European cities.</p><h4>Official hotel</h4><p>A discounted room block is available at Hôtel d'Angleterre Grenoble.</p></div>
        </div>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2 id="accommodation">Accommodation</h2><p>A discounted room block is available at <strong>Hôtel d'Angleterre Grenoble</strong> in the city center.</p><p><strong>Booking code:</strong> <code>VATES</code><br /><strong>Room block:</strong> April 1-4, 2026<br /><strong>Book by:</strong> March 1, 2026</p>
        <ul><li>99 EUR standard single</li><li>109 EUR standard double</li><li>129 EUR superior single</li><li>139 EUR superior double</li></ul>
        <p>Breakfast is included. <a href="https://www.hotel-angleterre-grenoble.com">Hotel website</a></p>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2>Why Grenoble?</h2><p>Grenoble has a long tradition of excellence in research, open collaboration, and systems engineering. Hosting the meetup at Université Grenoble Alpes strengthens ties between industry, academia, and the open-source community.</p>
      </Section>

      <Section class="section-square-rounded content-markdown">
        <div id="sponsors"><h2>Thank You to Our Sponsors</h2><p>Special thanks to local co-organizers Fabienne Boyer and Alain Tchana from KrakOS (Inria / LIG / CNRS).</p>
          <div class="uno-grid uno-gap-10 uno-grid-cols-1 md:uno-grid-cols-2 uno-items-center uno-justify-items-center uno-my-20">
            <a href="https://www.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/"><img src="/img/others/spring-meetup-2026/uga.svg" alt="Université Grenoble Alpes logo" /></a>
            <a href="https://www.liglab.fr/"><img src="/img/others/spring-meetup-2026/lig.png" alt="Laboratoire d'Informatique de Grenoble logo" /></a>
            <a href="https://vates.tech"><img src="/img/logos/vates-logo.svg" alt="Vates logo" /></a>
            <a href="https://www.renesas.com/"><img src="/img/logos/renesas-logo-cropped.svg" alt="Renesas logo" /></a>
            <a href="https://www.honda.com/"><img src="/img/logos/honda-logo.svg" alt="Honda logo" /></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown"><h2>Stay Informed</h2><p>This page will be updated with schedule, speaker, travel, venue, and sponsor information.</p></Section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
